{"framework":"vue","displayName":"Columns ▸ Column headers · Add a tooltip to a column header · Vue 3","tier":2,"engine":"container","sandpackTemplate":null,"sandpackEnvironment":null,"container":"vue","htWrappers":["@handsontable/vue3"],"entry":"/src/main.ts","htmlEntry":"/index.html","devCommand":"pnpm exec vite --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173","buildCommand":"vite build","outputDir":"dist","outputGlob":null,"staticExport":false,"spaMode":false,"port":5173,"installCommand":"pnpm install","htCoreRange":"0.0.0-next-eb40b40-20261105","fileCount":5,"assets":[],"skipped":[],"files":{"/package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"handsontable-vue-example\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@10.34.5\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"handsontable\": \"0.0.0-next-eb40b40-20261105\",\n    \"@handsontable/vue3\": \"0.0.0-next-eb40b40-20261105\",\n    \"vue\": \"3.x\",\n    \"vite\": \"^5.4.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  }\n}","/vite.config.js":"import { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport vue from \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({ plugins: [vue()], server: { allowedHosts: true } });","/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Handsontable Vue Example</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"example8\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.ts\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","/src/main.ts":"import { createApp } from \"vue\";\nimport App from \"./App.vue\";\ncreateApp(App).mount(\"#example8\");","/src/App.vue":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref } from 'vue';\nimport { HotTable } from '@handsontable/vue3';\nimport { registerAllModules } from 'handsontable/registry';\nimport type { GridSettings } from 'handsontable/settings';\n\n// register Handsontable's modules\nregisterAllModules();\n\n// Descriptions keyed by header label, so each one stays with its column when users move columns.\nconst descriptions: Record<string, string> = {\n  'Atomic Number': 'Number of protons in the nucleus',\n  'Atomic Mass (u)': 'Average mass of an atom, in unified atomic mass units (u)',\n  'Melting Point (°F)': 'Temperature at which the element melts, in degrees Fahrenheit',\n  'Boiling Point (°F)': 'Temperature at which the element boils, in degrees Fahrenheit',\n};\n\nconst hotSettings = ref<GridSettings>({\n  data: [\n    ['Hydrogen', 'H', 1, 1.008, 7, -434.4, -423.2],\n    ['Helium', 'He', 2, 4.003, 9, -458.0, -452.1],\n    ['Lithium', 'Li', 3, 6.94, 9, 356.9, 2447.6],\n    ['Beryllium', 'Be', 4, 9.012, 11, 2348.6, 4478.8],\n    ['Boron', 'B', 5, 10.81, 15, 3768.8, 7100.6],\n  ],\n  colHeaders: ['Name', 'Symbol', 'Atomic Number', 'Atomic Mass (u)', 'Known Isotopes', 'Melting Point (°F)', 'Boiling Point (°F)'],\n  columns: [\n    {},\n    {},\n    { type: 'numeric' },\n    { type: 'numeric', numericFormat: { minimumFractionDigits: 3, maximumFractionDigits: 3, useGrouping: false } },\n    { type: 'numeric' },\n    { type: 'numeric', numericFormat: { minimumFractionDigits: 1, maximumFractionDigits: 1, useGrouping: false } },\n    { type: 'numeric', numericFormat: { minimumFractionDigits: 1, maximumFractionDigits: 1, useGrouping: false } },\n  ],\n  // Handsontable reuses header cells, so set or remove the `title` attribute on every call.\n  afterGetColHeader(column, TH) {\n    const label = TH.querySelector('.colHeader')?.textContent ?? '';\n    const description = descriptions[label];\n\n    if (description) {\n      TH.title = description;\n    } else {\n      TH.removeAttribute('title');\n    }\n  },\n  rowHeaders: true,\n  manualColumnMove: true,\n  height: 'auto',\n  autoWrapRow: true,\n  autoWrapCol: true,\n  // licenseKey: 'your-license-key', // get a key at https://handsontable.com/pricing/\n});\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div id=\"example8\">\n    <HotTable :settings=\"hotSettings\" />\n  </div>\n</template>"},"docsPath":"guides/columns/column-header/vue/example8.vue","breadcrumb":["Columns","Column headers"],"guide":"guides/columns/column-header/column-header.md","guideTitle":"Column headers","exampleId":"example8","exampleTitle":"Add a tooltip to a column header","docPermalink":"/column-header","lang":"Vue 3"}
